@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:55643


###
# Variáveis
@api = http://localhost:8081
@kc = http://localhost:8080
@realm = radar
@client_id = radar-api
@client_secret = COLOQUE_AQUI
@username = organizador
@password = COLOQUE_AQUI
@token = COLE_O_ACCESS_TOKEN_AQUI
@eventoId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@novoUsuarioId = 11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555

### 1) Auth - Obter token (Keycloak)
POST {{kc}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id={{client_id}}&client_secret={{client_secret}}&username={{username}}&password={{password}}

### 2) Auth - Identidade atual
GET {{api}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 3) Usuários - Self-onboarding
POST {{api}}/api/v1/usuarios/self
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nome": "Usuário Visu",
  "email": "visu@example.com"
}

### 4) Admin - Listar permissões
GET {{api}}/api/v1/admin/permissoes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 5) Admin - Criar/atribuir usuário a um papel (único papel por usuário)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/admin/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "{{novoUsuarioId}}",
  "nome": "Usuário Organizador",
  "email": "org@example.com",
  "papel": "ORGANIZADOR"
}

### 6) Eventos públicos - Listar próximos
GET {{api}}/api/v1/public/eventos
Accept: application/json

### 7) Eventos públicos - Obter por ID
GET {{api}}/api/v1/public/eventos/{{eventoId}}
Accept: application/json

### 8) Admin - Criar evento
POST {{api}}/api/v1/admin/eventos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nome": "Copa Radar",
  "data": "2025-10-10T18:00:00Z",
  "nomeLocal": "Praça Central"
}

### 9) Ranking público
GET {{api}}/api/v1/public/ranking
Accept: application/json

### 10) Infra - Health
GET {{api}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 11) Infra - Swagger
GET {{api}}/swagger/index.html
